docs/WeChat-Mini-Program.md lists these WeChat custom tab bar projects as references:
  https://github.com/mtjsoft/customTabBar
  https://github.com/Jonham/weapp-component-tabbar
  https://github.com/jiangdoc/wxChar
  https://github.com/handwill/weapp-custom-tabbar
  https://github.com/LonJinUp/wxTabBar
They were used for the approach only (app.json "tabBar": {"custom": true} with a custom-tab-bar component, a raised
middle button, getTabBar() in the tab pages). No source code, image or other file of them is included here.

The skin images in miniprogram/shared/skins are copies of Example-Shared/Configurations/Skins of this repository.
